OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry
OL,8,Falthough clouding over at times across
OL,9,Fthe east. Cold with a widespread frost
OL,10,Fand freshening southeasterly wind
OL,11,Fadding to the cold feel.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAll parts will have a dry and
OL,14,Fcold day with some spells of sunshine.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,17,Fand bright on Monday. Chance of rain
OL,18,Fat times on Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,19,FFresh southeasterly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
